1
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:05,853
[Title · Poet] First Snow ― Myungdojae Lee Myung-woo

2
00:00:06,953 --> 00:00:10,541
[Stanza 1 · First Snow & Longing] Quietly, I call out the name of the first snow

3
00:00:10,691 --> 00:00:14,315
[Stanza 1 · First Snow & Longing] Standing in the schoolyard, the day slows down

4
00:00:14,465 --> 00:00:17,847
[Stanza 1 · First Snow & Longing] A cool breeze gently rests upon my cheek

5
00:00:18,047 --> 00:00:20,318
[Stanza 1 · First Snow & Longing] A single white snowflake

6
00:00:20,428 --> 00:00:23,776
[Stanza 1 · First Snow & Longing] Settles on my shoulder like an old longing

7
00:00:24,876 --> 00:00:28,304
[Stanza 2 · White Flutter in the Schoolyard] The schoolyard where we built a snowman as children

8
00:00:28,454 --> 00:00:32,756
[Stanza 2 · White Flutter in the Schoolyard] That girl who smiled, blowing warmth into her small hands

9
00:00:32,906 --> 00:00:35,702
[Stanza 2 · White Flutter in the Schoolyard] Put two dark eyes upon the snowman

10
00:00:35,832 --> 00:00:38,897
[Stanza 2 · White Flutter in the Schoolyard] And left a white flutter inside my heart

11
00:00:39,997 --> 00:00:44,472
[Stanza 3 · The Promise of First Snow] The words saying, let us meet again when the first snow falls

12
00:00:44,622 --> 00:00:47,492
[Stanza 3 · The Promise of First Snow] I cannot recall who spoke them first

13
00:00:47,642 --> 00:00:50,775
[Stanza 3 · The Promise of First Snow] Yet every year when the first snow comes

14
00:00:50,885 --> 00:00:53,936
[Stanza 3 · The Promise of First Snow] I quietly take out that promise alone

15
00:00:55,036 --> 00:00:57,910
[Stanza 4 · Warm Footprints & Little Flower] In the place where the girl once passed

16
00:00:58,020 --> 00:01:00,612
[Stanza 4 · Warm Footprints & Little Flower] Do her warm footprints still remain?

17
00:01:00,912 --> 00:01:03,807
[Stanza 4 · Warm Footprints & Little Flower] Is the heart I could not confess that day

18
00:01:03,937 --> 00:01:07,270
[Stanza 4 · Warm Footprints & Little Flower] Blooming like a tiny flower buried in the snow?

19
00:01:08,370 --> 00:01:12,197
[Stanza 5 · First Snow Falling Today] Today again, the first snow falls on the schoolyard

20
00:01:12,397 --> 00:01:14,879
[Stanza 5 · First Snow Falling Today] The snowman is no longer there

21
00:01:15,009 --> 00:01:17,893
[Stanza 5 · First Snow Falling Today] And I do not know where that girl lives now

22
00:01:18,893 --> 00:01:21,917
[Stanza 6 · The Boy Waiting Within] Whenever the day of the first snow arrives

23
00:01:22,067 --> 00:01:24,723
[Stanza 6 · The Boy Waiting Within] A young boy deep within my heart

24
00:01:24,923 --> 00:01:27,251
[Stanza 6 · The Boy Waiting Within] Is still waiting for that girl.
